  "ts": "2026-05-26T08:31:47.228374Z",
  "content": "Use the Must pattern for process-critical startup: config.MustLoad, ai.MustBuildEmbedder, store.MustOpen, store.MustDefaultDBPath, config.MustDefaultPath. They panic on failure to prevent the service starting half-broken. Error-returning versions stay exported for tests; the Must wrappers are what main.go uses. Tom's principle: \"things the process relies on should use the Must pattern\" - avoid deferred failure where a missing dep only surfaces when the first request hits it.",
